  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><p data-lake-id=\"uf16c11b0\" id=\"uf16c11b0\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7746fcf4\" id=\"u7746fcf4\">数据有不同的类型，不同类型数据之间进行混合运算时涉及到类型的转换问题。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u51ea5b01\" id=\"u51ea5b01\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6324344c\" id=\"u6324344c\">转换的方法有两种：</span></p><ul list=\"u3d2bf275\"><li fid=\"u03923bd1\" data-lake-id=\"u90c75df1\" id=\"u90c75df1\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1c256606\" id=\"u1c256606\">自动类型转换（隐式转换）：遵循一定的规则，由编译系统自动完成</span></li><li fid=\"u03923bd1\" data-lake-id=\"u5f7b3344\" id=\"u5f7b3344\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3e740af5\" id=\"u3e740af5\">强制类型转换（显示转换）：把表达式的运算结果强制转换成所需的数据类型</span></li></ul><ul list=\"u3d2bf275\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u03923bd1\" data-lake-id=\"u884fa86e\" id=\"u884fa86e\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua8e2afff\" id=\"ua8e2afff\">语法格式： (类型)变量或常量</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u3de4ce13\" id=\"u3de4ce13\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u93ab57bd\" id=\"u93ab57bd\">类型转换的原则：</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"u610ecdeb\" id=\"u610ecdeb\"><span data-lake-id=\"uac693d40\" id=\"uac693d40\">占用内存字节数少(值域小)的类型，向占用内存字节数多(值域大)的类型转换，以保证精度不降低、数据不溢出。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u78d4a050\" id=\"u78d4a050\" style=\"text-indent: 2em; padding-left: 2em\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fpng%2F29103019%2F1685870042949-e6638cc6-04bd-4f41-a7ed-9d7c660c538c.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u12660ef0-9523-40c2-93b1-b6bea745931%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22uaa687fda-4f41-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A342.00001525878906%2C%22height%22%3A209%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A21445%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A864%2C%22originHeight%22%3A529%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.75%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22search%22%3A%22%E9%AB%98%20FLOAT%20DOUBLE%20LONG%20UNSI%20GNED%20INT%20%E4%BD%8ESIGNED%20INT%20CHAR%2CSHORT%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22x%22%3A11%2C%22y%22%3A8%2C%22width%22%3A51%2C%22height%22%3A58%2C%22text%22%3A%22%E9%AB%98%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A602%2C%22y%22%3A10%2C%22width%22%3A147%2C%22height%22%3A47%2C%22text%22%3A%22FLOAT%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A239%2C%22y%22%3A11%2C%22width%22%3A178%2C%22height%22%3A44%2C%22text%22%3A%22DOUBLE%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A286%2C%22y%22%3A184%2C%22width%22%3A111%2C%22height%22%3A46%2C%22text%22%3A%22LONG%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A104%2C%22y%22%3A321%2C%22width%22%3A243%2C%22height%22%3A55%2C%22text%22%3A%22UNSI%20GNED%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A383%2C%22y%22%3A326%2C%22width%22%3A81%2C%22height%22%3A41%2C%22text%22%3A%22INT%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A10%2C%22y%22%3A467%2C%22width%22%3A267%2C%22height%22%3A56%2C%22text%22%3A%22%E4%BD%8ESIGNED%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A317%2C%22y%22%3A473%2C%22width%22%3A79%2C%22height%22%3A42%2C%22text%22%3A%22INT%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A456%2C%22y%22%3A474%2C%22width%22%3A398%2C%22height%22%3A42%2C%22text%22%3A%22CHAR%2CSHORT%22%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f4f4f4%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u1ada337a%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u10fc0569\" id=\"u10fc0569\" style=\"text-indent: 2em; padding-left: 2em\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn%5Cnint%20main()%20%7B%5Cn%5Ct%2F%2F%20%E9%9A%90%E5%BC%8F%E8%BD%AC%E6%8D%A2%EF%BC%88%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E8%BD%AC%E6%8D%A2%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9A%E7%BC%96%E8%AF%91%E5%99%A8%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E8%BD%AC%E6%8D%A2%5Cn%5Ctint%20a%20%3D%2011%3B%5Cn%5Ctdouble%20b%20%3D%20a%3B%20%2F%2F%E5%B0%86a%E7%9A%84%E5%80%BC%EF%BC%8C11%EF%BC%8C%E8%BD%AC%E6%8D%A2%E4%B8%BA11.0000%EF%BC%8C%E5%8